yle=\"--framer-text-color:var(--token-0b79d5f0-89f5-47c4-8a58-de255a4ff14d)\">12 · Questions</p></div><!--$--><div class=\"framer-eblqqi ml-rise\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"transform:none\"><h2 class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1mrw2ji\" data-styles-preset=\"yR_STutVj\" dir=\"auto\">What teams ask before they upload anything.</h2></div><!--/$--><div class=\"framer-w8cfdz\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"transform:none\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1nupm5d\" data-styles-preset=\"AHAXTwDzD\" dir=\"auto\">Something else on your mind? A data engineer answers every message within one working day.</p></div><!--$--><!--$--><a class=\"framer-14p0fhh framer-lux5qc ml-press\" data-border=\"true\" data-framer-name=\"Button · Ask us directly\" href=\"/contact\"><div class=\"framer-1vhmrr\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"transform:none\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1pqkpa6\" data-styles-preset=\"JUO30hGfB\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"--framer-text-color:var(--token-e282a826-450e-41a9-9c3a-98f9cb4d10b9)\">Ask us directly</p></div><div class=\"framer-5l5f5u\" data-framer-component-type=\"RichTextContainer\" style=\"transform:none\"><p class=\"framer-text framer-styles-preset-1pqkpa6\" data-styles-preset=\"JUO30hGfB\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"--framer-text-color:var(--token-0b79d5f0-89f5-47c4-8a58-de255a4ff14d)\">→</p></div></a><!--/$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"framer-l66v72-container\" data-code-component-plugin-id=\"api\" data-framer-name=\"FAQ\" name=\"FAQ\"><!--$--><div style=\"width:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:'Funnel Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;color:#111317\"><div style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(17,19,23,.12);position:relative\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:-1px;height:2px;width:100%;background:#FF4B1F;transition:width .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)\"></div><button class=\"mlk-q\" aria-expanded=\"true\" 