position:absolute;left:0;top:8px;width:18px;height:2px;background:#111317\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:8px;top:0;width:2px;height:18px;background:#111317;transform:scaleY(1);transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)\"></span></span></button><div id=\"mlfaq-1\" role=\"region\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-rows:0fr;transition:grid-template-rows .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden\"><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 48px 26px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(17,19,23,.72);max-width:720px\">During setup you confirm about thirty definitions (revenue, active account, churn) in a shared glossary. Every answer shows which definition it used, and changing one re-weaves the answers that depend on it.</p></div></div></div><div style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(17,19,23,.12);position:relative\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:-1px;height:2px;width:0%;background:#FF4B1F;transition:width .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)\"></div><button class=\"mlk-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mlfaq-2\" style=\"all:unset;cursor:pointer;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:24px 0\"><span style=\"font-family:'Funnel Display', 'Funnel Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.25\">What happens when an answer is wrong?</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:relative;width:18px;height:18px;flex:0 0 auto\"><span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:8px;width:18px;height:2px;background:#111317\"></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:8px;top:0;width:2px;height:18px;background:#111317;transform:scaleY(1);transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)\"></span></span></button><div id=\"mlfaq-2\" role=\"region\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-rows:0fr;transition:grid-template-rows .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1)\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden\"><p style=\"m